<title>USA: MAIC allocates $5 mln for shr buybacks.</title>
<headline>MAIC allocates $5 mln for shr buybacks.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAIC Holdings Inc said Thursday its allocated an additional $5 million to buy back its stock.</p>
<p>The company said it had previously authorized $10 million for share purchases. Of that amount, $2.7 million remained available as of March 31.</p>
<p>The company said the shares it buys will be available for potential business combinations.</p>
<p>MAIC Holdings, through its subsidiary companies, provides malpractice insurance to physicians, hospitals, dentists, and health care organizations.</p>
